# ⚠ THESE TWO FILES ARE GONE (health #1250, 2026-08-29) — the retired
# `pippijn@xinutec.org` pair, removed because a keypair whose private half was
# published does not belong in a public repo. The filters STAY on purpose: they
# cost nothing, and they are what encrypts a key of either name if one is ever
# added back by hand. A guard, not a claim that the files exist.
#
# ⚠ Removal from HEAD is not removal from HISTORY. The encrypted blobs remain in
# every clone's object store; rewriting that is a separate and much larger
# question, deliberately not bundled here.
/id_ed25519 filter=git-crypt diff=git-crypt
/id_rsa filter=git-crypt diff=git-crypt
